{%- comment -%}
PFC Front of Mind — grounding anchors from data/grounding.ndjson.

`anchors` is every active anchor, created ascending (the full view shows all).
`anchors_rotated` is the same list rotated by the 15-minute clock index, so the
smaller views lead with a different anchor each refresh and the whole set
cycles into view over time.

No shared captures are needed; this file is kept so every plugin folder has the
same shape. E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles — framework classes only.
{%- endcomment -%}
